<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Resource Directory</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Defaulting to serif for body text */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; /* Sans-serif for headings */
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .contact-info p {
    margin: 2px 0;
    font-size: 12pt;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 16pt;">On- Campus Counseling Resources- Confidential Reporting Options</h1>
  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>RENEW Counseling Center</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">Off Campus Counseling Resources- Confidential Reporting Options</h2>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Variety Health Clinic</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>YWCA - Oklahoma City</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>24-hour Crisis Line: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
    <p>YWCA Crisis Services Sexual Assault Hotline: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Oklahoma Coalition Against Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Women's Resource Center, Norman, OK</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>Hotline: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Women's Service & Family Resource Center</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Shawnee Project Safe</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>Rape Hotline: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">Other Local Services Available To Victims - Non-Confidential Reporting Options</h2>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Bethany Police Department</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Oklahoma City Police Department</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">Medical Services</h2>
  <p>It's important to have a thorough medical examination after a sexual assault even if the victim does not have any apparent physical injuries. Medical providers can treat injuries and test for sexually transmitted infections.</p>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Deaconess Hospital</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Integris Baptist Medical Center</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>OU Medicine</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Mercy Hospital Oklahoma</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>St. Anthony Hospital</p>
    <p><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="address.city_state_zip">{{ address.city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>